name sghatecheck-testcases
# The README, "/testcases": "This folder contains test cases that were generated using the techniques described in
# the paper." It does not describe the columns; their names are the files' own, in the first row:
#   p_label, p_value, p_target, c_testcase, t_case_local, t_function, t_gold, t_direction, t_id
# A test case has no name of its own here: it is the text it is (c_testcase). A column without a name says nothing.
match testcases/*_testcases_all.csv
grammar table
separator ,
header
quoted

claims
together
subject in c_testcase
attest *
